    <statement><p>Evaluate each expression using the given graph of <m>f(x)</m>.</p>
<p>Enter <alert> DNE </alert> if the limit or value does not exist.</p>
<p>If you are having a hard time seeing the picture clearly, click
on the picture.  It will expand to a larger picture on its own page so
that you can inspect it more clearly.</p>
